    // suites boot fresh copies of the app by writing its own HTML (fetch(location.href)) into an iframe. On the source file
    // each boot made babel-standalone compile the 1.2 MB app again (~5 s; the run log printed one "[BABEL] Note: ... exceeds
    // the max of 500KB" per compile: 29 in a source run, 68 in a testing-build run). isolatedBootHtml(appHtml, win) instead
    // hands the iframe the code babel-standalone already produced for THIS page, the way dist/index.html is built
