    // Tailwind JIT primer reads it), and the compiled code runs at DOMContentLoaded, the moment babel-standalone would run it,
    // from a tiny loader put where the babel tag was (so it registers its listener at the same point in the parse).
    // What is reused is pinned, not guessed: babel-standalone appends one plain <script> whose inline source map names
